2,Akeu,https://accentnetwork.com/akeu/,"Akeu, a Sino-Tibetan language, is spoken by about 10,000 people in the border regions of Myanmar, China, and Thailand. The Akeu people maintain a distinct cultural identity with influences from neighboring ethnic groups.",Akeu,Sino-Tibetan
